<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="loading-overlay" data-kv-variant="content" data-klic-component="loading-overlay" class="kn-loading-overlay"><div data-part="overlay-wrap"><section data-klic-surface="card" data-part="panel"><header data-part="heading"><strong>프로젝트 통계</strong></header><div data-part="metric"><span>방문자</span><strong>1,248</strong><p data-part="muted"></p></div><svg viewBox="0 0 180 56" role="img" aria-label="기간별 추세: 40, 33, 38, 21, 29, 12, 17, 8" data-part="spark"><polyline points="0,40 25,33 50,38 75,21 100,29 125,12 150,17 175,8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/></svg></section><div role="status" data-part="local-overlay"><span aria-hidden="true" class="ku-spin" data-part="spinner"></span><strong>통계를 갱신하고 있습니다.</strong></div></div></div>
